<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About - Ambulance Tracking System</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="public/css/style.css" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .btn-group {
            margin-top: 20px;
            justify-content: center; /* Centers horizontally */
             align-items: center;   


        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            margin-right: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 5px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .btn-patient {
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #007bff;
            
        }
        .btn-driver {
            background-color: #28a745;
            justify-content: center;
            
           

        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Ambulance Tracking System</h1>
        <p>
            Welcome to the Real-Time Emergency Response & Fleet Tracking Portal. 
            This system coordinates emergency patient requests and live ambulance telemetry using WebSockets and PostgreSQL.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-group">
            <a href="/patient" class="btn btn-patient">Patient Portal</a>
            <a href="/driver" class="btn btn-driver">Driver Dashboard</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>